card-body"><div class="memo-evidence-line"><b>원문 근거</b><div class="evidence-row">${evidenceButtons(ev,title)}</div></div>${axes.length?`<div class="memo-axis-row"><b>관련 평가</b>${axes.map(x=>`<span>${esc(memoAxisLabel(x))}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:''}${s.cause?`<div class="memo-block"><span>원인</span><p>${esc(s.cause)}</p></div>`:''}${s.readerImpact||s.mechanism?`<div class="memo-block impact"><span>${kind.key==='required'?'왜 문제인가':kind.key==='refinement'?'왜 고도화할 가치가 있나':'왜 다듬을 수 있나'}</span><p>${esc(s.readerImpact||s.mechanism)}</p></div>`:''}${s.sourceText?`<div class="memo-diff"><div class="diff-line old"><small>원문</small>${esc(s.sourceText)}</div>${s.replacementText?`<div class="diff-line new"><small>권장</small>${esc(s.replacementText)}</div>`:''}</div>`:''}${arr(s.editOperations).length?`<div class="memo-block steps"><span>실행 단계</span><ol>${arr(s.editOperations).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ol></div>`:''}<div class="memo-block strategy"><span>수정 전략</span><p>${esc(s.suggestion||s.revisionDirection||'')}</p></div>${s.preserve||arr(s.preserveQualities).length?`<div class="memo-block preserve"><span>보존할 것</span>${arr(s.preserveQualities).length?`<ul>${arr(s.preserveQualities).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:`<p>${esc(s.preserve)}</p>`}</div>`:''}${s.successCheck?`<div class="memo-block success"><span>완료 확인 기준</span><p>${esc(s.successCheck)}</p></div>`:''}<div class="editorial-point-actions"><button class="point-question" data-action="director-point" data-index="${i}" data-ref="${esc(ref)}">${icon('message')}이 편집점에 질문</button><button class="point-exclusion ${rule?'on':''}" data-action="editorial-exclusion" data-index="${i}" data-ref="${esc(ref)}" data-rule="${esc(rule?.id||'')}"><span class="check-box">${rule?'✓':''}</span>${rule?'재제안 제외됨':'다음 수정본에서 제안하지 않기'}</button></div></div></details>`}
